            <p class="ck-theme">Rising beyond the eyes that define us.</p>
            <p class="ck-essence">Society often places invisible boundaries around who we should be, how we should behave, and what is considered acceptable. Many of these pressures are illusionary, they exist because they are repeated, not because they are true. Unbound invites people to shift from living according to external judgment to living according to inner truth: how we see ourselves, what our heart says, and what freedom feels like.</p>
