                Your time on this earth is not meant to be a performance for others. <br><br>
                It is <span class="illuminated-yours">YOURS</span>.
            </span>
            <p class="description-para">Unbound is a social project dedicated to awakening the potential we hold beyond the weight of expectations. It begins the moment you learn to choose yourself and what you love. It begins when you stop shrinking to fit spaces that feel uncomfortable. It is a movement toward conscious freedom ~ a reminder that your life, choices, and joy are yours to define.</p>
