    <div id="about-page" class="full-page-overlay">
        <div class="close-btn" onclick="toggleOverlay('about-page', false)">Close</div>
        <div class="overlay-content">
            <h2>About Unbound</h2>
            <div class="about-text">
                In an age of growing awareness, education, and evolution, we are no longer meant to remain tethered to outdated patterns of living. It is a gentle invitation to release what no longer serves you ~ the unhealthy habits, the silent expectations, and the unseen pressures that ask you to fit into a life already defined.
                <br><br>
                At its heart, Unbound is a return to self. To be unbound is to set yourself free from limiting patterns and inherited conditioning, and to step into a life shaped by your own conscious choices. It is about living fully in the present, embracing your inner voice, and honoring the truth that we are independent, aware beings meant to experience life in our own unique way.
                <br><br>
                Unbound believes that true freedom is not loud or forceful, but deeply personal ~ it begins the moment you choose yourself.
            </div>
            
            <div class="box-msg">
                <span style="font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif; display: block; margin-bottom: 20px; font-size: 1.2rem;">A Message from the Founder</span>
                <div class="about-text" style="font-style: italic; text-align: center; margin-bottom: 20px;">
